                    print("Joe: I'm Monkey Joe — a rules-based AI assistant built by Akiva! I answer questions from my knowledge base covering coding, science, history, animals, food, and much more. I'm not an LLM like Claude — I match patterns against stored facts. 🐒\n")
                    continue

                # Compliments
